          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Daily Beauty Sleep™?",
            "answer": "<p>A beauty sleep supplement made for women who don’t get enough sleep. Two capsules a night combine Imperial Lingzhi™ with seven botanicals and probiotics, to support deeper rest and help you wake up with a natural glow.</p>"
