        "b2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does beauty sleep work?",
            "answer": "<p>Beauty sleep is your body’s natural overnight recovery. While you rest, your body does its quiet repair and renewal work. Daily Beauty Sleep™ supports it with 8 ingredients for restful sleep, relaxation, antioxidant support and gut health.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is it different from other sleep supplements?",
            "answer": "<p>Most sleep aids focus only on helping you fall asleep. Daily Beauty Sleep™ is a supplement for sleep and skin together, with 400 mg of Imperial Lingzhi™ and probiotics for the gut-skin connection.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take it?",
            "answer": "<p>Take 2 capsules daily, 30–60 minutes before bed. Make it part of your evening routine, like your skincare.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I notice a difference?",
            "answer": "<p>Everyone is different. Many women take Yuna every night for at least a month, as sleep and skin both respond best to a consistent ritual.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is it different from melatonin for sleep?",
            "answer": "<p>Melatonin is a hormone, and many sleep aids sold in Singapore rely on it. Daily Beauty Sleep™ is a melatonin-free sleep aid. It uses herbs such as Imperial Lingzhi™, jujube seed and L-theanine to help you relax into sleep, and supports your skin while you rest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe? Does lingzhi have side effects?",
            "answer": "<p>Lingzhi has a long history of traditional use. Our lingzhi supplement is plant-based and third-party lab tested, in a GMP and HACCP certified facility. As with any supplement, if you are pregnant, breastfeeding, taking medication or have a medical condition, please check with your doctor first.</p>"
